183162689", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2640225186496022_5088773936030634438_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l0dAdTKscMkQ7kNvwHDHVB_&_nc_oc=AdrC-qG0_YWAuqnL43Jwk7EhDxa1GcJUh7LCo5EiwKwtuWJoBsKFszGQ-zG7ZP0TP-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSFJYR5gOKLkQrdn7yxCQHwNpAGeJyninEHNMhHPI-OSg&oe=6B05B012"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Steal a DeadRot", "keywords": ["Bainrots", "StealaDeadRot", "StealaBrainRot"], "long_description": "Steal a DeadRot!\n\nBuy them. Build your base. Steal everyone else\u2019s!\n\nBrainrots walk down the carpet one after another. Grab the ones you want, place them in your base, and watch the money pour in. Rarer brainrots earn far more.\n\nBut watch out: other players can sneak in and steal your best brainrots, and you can steal theirs too!\n\nFeatures:\n\nCollect brainrots across several rarity levels\nFind mutations like Gold that boost income\nSteal from other players\u2019 bases and race them home\nDefend your base with locks, traps and slaps\nRebirth to unlock new floors, more slots and bigger income\nBuy gear from the shop\nEarn money even while offline\nUnlock cosmetics in the wardrobe\nMultiplayer with proximity voice chat\nDay and night cycle\n\nGuard your base and become the richest player in the lobby!\n\nJoin - discord.gg/stellasstuff\n{1844585149882367}\n{1554592813364449}\n{1138583811892982}\n{3128045200861528}\n{1900971907937229}\n{1687475836099717}\n{1800773534501619}", "short_description": "Steal a DeadRot!\n\nCollect brainrots, build your base, and earn cash in this multiplayer VR tycoon game! Grab rare and mutated brainrots, steal from other players\u2019 bases, and defend your own with locks and traps. Rebirth to unlock new floors and become the richest player in the lobby!\n\nJoin - discord.gg/stellasstuff"}]}, "developer_name": "GrahamVR", "developer_privacy_pol